  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa de Apoyo a la integracin socio urbana de la poblacin migrante</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support Program for the socio-urban integration of the migrant population</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Complementar los alcances del Programa de Mejoramiento de Barrios (PMB) (4651OC-UR), vinculando la poblacin inmigrante vulnerable y su comunidad receptora. Sus objetivos especficos son: (i) propiciar la integracin urbana a travs de la provisin de infraestructura bsica formal, servicios sociales y urbanos adecuados, garantizando la tenencia segura de la propiedad y mejorando el capital social, con consideraciones de cambio climtico; y (ii) proveer vivienda asequible a poblacin de bajos ingresos, a la vez que se recuperan espacios urbanizados degradados, en el centro histrico de Montevideo.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Expand the scope of the Neighborhood Improvement Program (PMB) (4651OC-UR), linking the vulnerable immigrant population and its receiving community. The specific objectives aligned with this program are: (i) to promote urban integration through the provision of basic formal infrastructure, adequate social and urban services, guaranteeing secure property tenure and improving social capital, with climate change considerations; and (ii) to provide affordable housing for the low-income population, while recovering degraded urbanized spaces in the historic center of Montevideo.</narrative>
  </description>
